flowchart LR
    U[Corps member / agent browser] -->|HTTPS request| CF[Cloudflare DNS\nAuthoritative DNS only\nEmail Routing]
    R[Domain registrar\nneatandaffordable.com\nRenewal + nameservers] -->|Nameservers| CF

    CF -->|A / CNAME\nDNS-only records| V[Vercel\nNext.js marketplace\nHTTPS + Vercel Firewall]
    V -->|HTML, assets, API responses| U

    U -->|Email to support@| CF
    CF -->|MX routing + forwarding| I[Verified support inbox\nGmail / Zoho / Outlook]
    I -->|Human support replies| U

    V -->|Server-side transactional email API\nNo client secret| RS[Resend]
    RS -->|SPF / DKIM authenticated mail\nupdates.neatandaffordable.com| U
    RS -->|Delivery / bounce events| V

    DNS[Cloudflare DNS records] -.->|Resend-generated SPF, DKIM, MX/TXT\nfor sending subdomain| RS
    DNS -.->|Cloudflare-generated MX, SPF, DKIM\nfor root Email Routing| CF
    DNS -.->|Vercel-provided A / CNAME\nfor web domain| V

    P[Paystack] -->|Signed webhook + server verification| V
    V -->|Payment receipt / premium status email| RS

